CheckSignature_Concrete_Test
├── when the signature recovers to the signer
│   └── it should accept it, even if the signer has code
└── when the signature does not recover to the signer
    ├── when the signer has no code
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when the signer has code
        ├── when its isValidSignature returns the magic value
        │   └── it should accept it
        └── when its isValidSignature gives any other answer
            └── it should revert
